@startuml
title BLE security flow

actor "Phone\ncentral" as Phone
participant "ESP32\nperipheral" as ESP
participant "GATT\nserver" as GATT

Phone -> ESP : scan advertising
Phone -> ESP : connect
Phone -> GATT : read or write protected attribute
GATT -> ESP : security required
ESP -> Phone : security request
Phone <-> ESP : pairing method\nJust Works, Passkey, Numeric, OOB
Phone <-> ESP : key distribution\nLTK, IRK, CSRK
Phone <-> ESP : encrypted link
Phone -> GATT : protected GATT access

@enduml
